  "value": "addSong(title) stores a song and returns its id; ids are 1, 2, 3, ... in call order and never reused; titles may repeat. playSong(songId, userId) records that the user played the song (void). getAnalytics() returns [title, number of DISTINCT users who played the song] for every song, sorted by that count descending, ties by smaller song id (output form and tie rule inferred).",
